            "answer": "<p>9.1 The Retailer must comply with all laws applicable to its business, including consumer protection, advertising, data protection, and tax laws.</p><p>9.2 The Retailer must not make any representation or give any warranty in respect of the Products beyond those given by Stendig.</p>"
